WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.311
The commonest CSAT mistake?

2
00:00:02.311 --> 00:00:03.932
Answering from what you know,

3
00:00:03.932 --> 00:00:05.387
instead of what the passage

4
00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:06.228
says.

5
00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:07.925
Main idea asks what the

6
00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:09.562
whole passage is about.

7
00:00:09.562 --> 00:00:11.720
Inference asks what must follow.

8
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.662
Assumption asks what the author

9
00:00:13.662 --> 00:00:15.322
takes for granted.

10
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.048
Watch for options that are

11
00:00:17.048 --> 00:00:18.588
true in the real world

12
00:00:18.588 --> 00:00:20.081
but not supported by the

13
00:00:20.081 --> 00:00:22.491
passage. Those are wrong.

14
00:00:23.178 --> 00:00:24.492
Options with always,

15
00:00:24.492 --> 00:00:26.342
never or only are usually

16
00:00:26.342 --> 00:00:27.537
too strong to be the

17
00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:28.488
answer.

18
00:00:28.819 --> 00:00:29.990
Your turn.

19
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.690
What must the right option

20
00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:32.475
be?
